OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786616298
OL,3,CLive facial recognition technology to
OL,4,Cbe deployed at Tube stations
OL,6,FLive facial recognition cameras are to
OL,7,Fbe deployed at London's Tube stations
OL,8,Ffrom Tuesday.
OL,10,FTransport for London said the
OL,11,Ftechnology would identify people on a
OL,12,Fpolice watchlist to help catch "high
OL,13,Fharm" offenders, such as those wanted
OL,14,Ffor sexual offences, robbery and knife
OL,15,Fcrime.
OL,17,FIt is being trialled by British
OL,18,FTransport Police (BTP) at key stations
OL,19,Ffor maximum impact based on
OL,20,Fintelligence and analysis of crime
OL,21,Fdata.
OL,26,@tD@`OUuD@EO]
