OL,3,CLive facial recognition technology to
OL,4,Cbe deployed at Tube stations
OL,6,FLive facial recognition involves
OL,7,Fscanning faces in real time.
OL,9,FImages of people who are not a match
OL,10,Fto the watchlist will be
OL,11,F"automatically and immediately
OL,12,Fdeleted", according to TfL.
OL,14,FThe trial in Tube stations will take
OL,15,Fplace in signed areas, allowing people
OL,16,Fto make "informed choices about
OL,17,Fpassing through", TfL said.
OL,19,FThere will be "alternative routes
OL,20,Favailable", BTP added.
OL,26,@sD@AOUtD@HO]xD@IOUyD@PO]{D@OOU|D@JO]
