OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786616298
OL,3,CLive facial recognition technology to
OL,4,Cbe deployed at Tube stations
OL,6,FThe first deployment on the Tube will
OL,7,Fbe at Victoria station on Tuesday.
OL,9,FLive facial recognition, which was
OL,10,Frolled out to all police forces in
OL,11,FEngland and Wales in January, has been
OL,12,Fwidely criticised by human rights
OL,13,Fgroups for infringing on civil
OL,14,Fliberties.
OL,16,FSiwan Hayward, director of security,
OL,17,Fpolicing and enforcement at TfL, said:
OL,18,F"Everyone should be able to travel
OL,19,Fwithout fear of harassment,
OL,20,Fintimidation or violence.
OL,26,@zD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/7
