CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786616298
OL,3,CLive facial recognition technology to
OL,4,Cbe deployed at Tube stations
OL,6,F"Tackling violence against women and
OL,7,Fgirls and preventing sexual offending
OL,8,Fon our network remains a key priority.
OL,10,F"Live facial recognition has the
OL,11,Fpotential to be a powerful additional
OL,12,Ftool in helping police quickly
OL,13,Fidentify those wanted for high-harm
OL,14,Foffences, including sexual offences,
OL,15,Fand supports early intervention and
OL,16,Fhelps stop incidents before they
OL,17,Fhappen."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUyD@HO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/7
