PN,37805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786616298
OL,3,CLive facial recognition technology to
OL,4,Cbe deployed at Tube stations
OL,6,FShe described the trial as "an
OL,7,Fimportant step" in understanding how
OL,8,Fthe technology can be used on the
OL,9,FLondon Underground network "in a
OL,10,Ftargeted, proportionate way with
OL,11,Fstrict safeguards in place".
OL,13,FChief Superintendent Chris Casey,
OL,14,FBTP's senior officer responsible for
OL,15,Fthe project, said: "This marks an
OL,16,Fimportant new stage in our trial of
OL,17,FLive facial recognition technology.
OL,26,@nD@\OUoD@OO]qD@\OUsD@[O]wD@TOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/7
