OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786616298
OL,3,CLive facial recognition technology to
OL,4,Cbe deployed at Tube stations
OL,6,F"Expanding deployments into London
OL,7,FUnderground stations will help us
OL,8,Fassess the technology in a different
OL,9,Ftransport environment while continuing
OL,10,Fto refine how it is used across the
OL,11,Frailway network.
OL,13,F"Our deployments are intelligence-led
OL,14,Fand focused on identifying people
OL,15,Fwanted by the police or courts,
OL,16,Fincluding those suspected of serious
OL,17,Foffences and those who may be
OL,18,Fbreaching bail conditions or court
OL,19,Forders."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOU{D@HO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/7
