OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1786616298
OL,3,CLive facial recognition technology to
OL,4,Cbe deployed at Tube stations
OL,6,FThe Met trialled Live facial
OL,7,Frecognition in August 2016 at the
OL,8,FNotting Hill Carnival, and first
OL,9,Fofficially deployed the technology in
OL,10,F2020.
